  "title": "Sweet Potato, Pear and Pineapple Bread Pudding",
  "description": "This bread pudding can be served as a decadent side dish or dessert. Creamy sweet potatoes, silky pears and tart pineapple with a pecan streusel topping. If serving for dessert, add chilled whipped cream. This casserole is quick and easy to make and also travels very well.",
  "authors": [
